                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Felt like it took forever to figure out. When I finally did, it was nothing but frustrating. I felt like the only way I could make any progress was to load up an autoclicker, mine until near death, then go buy health and diapers, change the little beat, repeat until I could buy everything I need and grind my way to escaping, freeing my parents, or inciting a revolution and failing.\n\nThis is the perfect game for anyone you hate, or if you just hate yourself and love getting pissed off from bad controls and contact boxes (i.e. the gun in the mine and clicking outside the dark spots around said cave's opening).",
